# Java GUI Shape Drawing Project

## Overview
This is an academic Java project developed to practice Object-Oriented Programming (OOP) concepts through a Graphical User Interface (GUI) for drawing shapes.

## Objectives
- Practice Object-Oriented Programming using Java.
- Build a graphical interface for drawing shapes.
- Apply programming concepts through a practical academic project.

## Technologies Used
- Java
- Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)
- Graphical User Interface (GUI)

## Project Purpose
This project was created as part of my academic practice to improve my understanding of OOP and GUI development in Java.

